{"description":"Registra on-chain (dpo2u-solana compliance-registry) uma pol\u00edtica de reten\u00e7\u00e3o previamente gerada. \u00c2ncora CID Lighthouse + content hash como Attestation PDA. Usa create_attestation (sem ZK) porque retention policies s\u00e3o p\u00fablicas.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"cid":{"description":"CID Lighthouse da policy","type":"string"},"cluster":{"description":"Target cluster","enum":["devnet","mainnet-beta","localnet"],"type":"string"},"contentHash":{"description":"sha256 hex de 64 chars (32 bytes)","pattern":"^[a-fA-F0-9]{64}$","type":"string"},"expiresAt":{"description":"Unix timestamp de expira\u00e7\u00e3o (opcional)","type":"number"},"schemaId":{"description":"Schema pubkey base58 (opcional)","type":"string"},"subjectPubkey":{"description":"Company pubkey base58 (default: issuer)","type":"string"}},"required":["cid","contentHash"],"type":"object"},"name":"register_retention_policy_onchain"}
